msgid "This device supports KNX Data Secure. Set a project password to commission it securely; without one it is added and commissioned in the clear."
msgstr "Toto zariadenie podporuje KNX Data Secure. Na jeho zabezpečené uvedenie do prevádzky nastavte heslo projektu; bez hesla sa pridá a uvedie do prevádzky nešifrovane."

